function:\n\n$$\nΓ(z)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\text{Re}(z)>0.\n$$\n\nWith this definition in mind, let's consider each of the given integrals.\n\n- Integral I does *not* match the definition. The integrand $\\frac{{e}^{t}}{{t}^{z-1}}$ is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.\n\n- Integral II matches the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{z}}{t{e}^{t}}\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t=Γ(z)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Integral III matches the definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t=Γ(z)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-827e9169-511c-5ab4-8026-8070fee5eb71"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-827e9169-511c-5ab4-8026-8070fee5eb71" :answer-field/id #uuid "827e9169-511c-5ab4-8026-8070fee5eb71" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3517e5b4-f44f-5fdf-86dc-8c2764fac2fa" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cc2337a1-6657-5fe8-b450-b5748ff50406" "answer-a20ca137-1425-5eff-b510-77f79db5e4cd" "answer-3517e5b4-f44f-5fdf-86dc-8c2764fac2fa" "answer-b47c0721-18a4-54a8-9623-8b427d44e5c2" "answer-2d9f6e2a-09b6-5d76-a955-98ec83b942b9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cc2337a1-6657-5fe8-b450-b5748ff50406" :answer/id #uuid "cc2337a1-6657-5fe8-b450-b5748ff50406" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a20ca137-1425-5eff-b510-77f79db5e4cd" :answer/id #uuid "a20ca137-1425-5eff-b510-77f79db5e4cd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3517e5b4-f44f-5fdf-86dc-8c2764fac2fa" :answer/id #uuid "3517e5b4-f44f-5fdf-86dc-8c2764fac2fa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II